{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56101","headline":"真人赞六首 六 · 杜光庭","name":"真人赞六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙通转我神，弘普无量功。\n道成天地初，轮化发九重。\n灭度历生死，缘对各有宗。\n孰悟去来苦，形魂无始终。\n积善隆福基，身拔五难锋。\n脱离三亚道，萧萧入闲堂。\n念度无边境，思定感神通。\n法轮三度回，辅我高仙功。\n回我大椿步，飘昇太极宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}